{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/6bfaa78d5f700b4614e117863e8857e3.poster.avif?t=1747855464\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/6bfaa78d5f700b4614e117863e8857e3.webm?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/6bfaa78d5f700b4614e117863e8857e3.mp4?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>TinyAttack is an action roguelite that puts you through endless hordes of enemies that gets increasingly harder over time.<br><br><u><strong>PERSEVERE THROUGH UNIQUE LEVELS:</strong></u><br>Try to find the Portal to the next level through uniquely generated maps, making no two playthroughs the same. Your enemies will slowly increase in size and power, allowing you no rest while you explore, loot and fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/df9bbade0fa511c1839ca0affd29f8e6.poster.avif?t=1747855464\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/df9bbade0fa511c1839ca0affd29f8e6.webm?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/df9bbade0fa511c1839ca0affd29f8e6.mp4?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>UNIQUE CHARACTERS:</strong></u><br>Each playable character comes with an unique set of skills, discover your own combat style and combine items into the mix in order to plow through your enemies. Master your strengths and play around your weakness in order to bring the best of your potential.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/3c62b54d0efe64c8bf576819458110cc.poster.avif?t=1747855464\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/3c62b54d0efe64c8bf576819458110cc.webm?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/3c62b54d0efe64c8bf576819458110cc.mp4?t=1747855464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>CHALLENGING BOSS FIGHTS:</strong></u><br>Bosses are literally armed to their teeth! A carefully hand crafted experience in order to bring you the best possible challenge, while random enemies and items keep the freshness in each fight. Each defeat a learning step and every victory bringing you closer to the real truth of this endless war.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1472970?t=1747855464","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747855464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747855464","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747855464","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2326470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1472970/extras/6bfaa78d5f700b4614e117863e8857e3.poster.avif?t=1747855464\" width=600 height=